# The two files in this repo that are GENERATED from the source, sent to a merge driver that resolves
# them instead of asking a person to hand-merge text nobody wrote (#2557).
#
# Both are produced from the tree, so any two branches touching the app's wording or its file list
# conflict on them by construction, and neither side's text carries a decision. The driver only removes
# the conflict; the freshness gates (scripts/check-pbxproj-fresh.sh and CopyInventoryTests, both inside
# scripts/test-all.sh) are what settle the content, on the complete merged tree.
#
# The driver is registered per clone by scripts/install-git-hooks.sh, because merge.<name>.driver lives
# in the git config, which is not tracked. Without that step git falls back to an ordinary text merge,
# which is exactly the behaviour this repo had before, so a clone that skips the installer is no worse
# off than it used to be.
docs/copy-inventory.md merge=overture-generated
mac/Overture.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj merge=overture-generated
